  "details": "It would be a wonderful addon to be able to set the look at \"me\" target to be any given object/physbone in the world.  This would allow for a person to do drone filming of another person or object as if it were themselves.  Additionally, you could set the look at 'point' to be say your hip bone so that you are centered vertically and horizontally on the screen when dancing or exploring during streaming content.",
